<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims to be paid for on August 21, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on August 19.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on August 14, raised 794.95 million francs and was priced at 99.685 percent to yield 1.250 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41 1 631 7340</p>
